# Local rollback snapshot of the live staging deploy (large; contains server secrets) - do not commit
/LIVE-BACKUP_manuforma-staging_majlis-data_2026-09-02/

# Real git-sync webhook config (repo URL, branch, HMAC secret) - lives ONLY on the live
# server, created once by hand from modules/git-sync-config.xql.template. Never commit this
# file: see modules/git-sync.xql's file-level comment (2026-09-07) for why - this repo's
# webhook syncs its own source files on every push to main, so any committed version of
# this file would get overwritten onto the live server the next time anything in this repo
# merges, silently replacing the real secret with whatever placeholder is in git.
modules/git-sync-config.xql
